{
  "id": "humanflow",
  "description": "Human Flow — búsqueda de un tema en PubMed y su recorrido por 13 capas del cuerpo, con cada dato citado",
  "pathPrefix": "src",
  "pathPrefixes": [
    "src/method",
    "src/pipeline",
    "src/engine",
    "src/export",
    "src/detail",
    "src/layers",
    "src/search",
    "worker"
  ],
  "aliases": [
    {
      "keys": [
        "capas",
        "layers",
        "mesh"
      ],
      "to": [
        "LAYERS",
        "layerMeshQuery",
        "layerOf"
      ]
    },
    {
      "keys": [
        "decisiones",
        "metodo"
      ],
      "to": [
        "DECISIONS",
        "METHOD_VERSION"
      ]
    },
    {
      "keys": [
        "esquema",
        "slots",
        "huecos"
      ],
      "to": [
        "SCHEMA",
        "slotsFor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "keys": [
        "recorrido",
        "pipeline",
        "buscar"
      ],
      "to": [
        "runTopic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "keys": [
        "control",
        "gate",
        "validar"
      ],
      "to": [
        "gateRows",
        "resolveLayer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "keys": [
        "dianas",
        "direccion",
        "cifras",
        "mediana"
      ],
      "to": [
        "targetsOf",
        "summarizeMeasures",
        "layerSummaries",
        "layerState"
      ]
    },
    {
      "keys": [
        "cadena",
        "eslabon"
      ],
      "to": [
        "chainsOf",
        "hopsOf"
      ]
    },
    {
      "keys": [
        "grafo"
      ],
      "to": [
        "graphOf",
        "NeuralGraph"
      ]
    },
    {
      "keys": [
        "dossier",
        "importar"
      ],
      "to": [
        "emptyDossier",
        "importDossier"
      ]
    },
    {
      "keys": [
        "fuentes",
        "exportar",
        "informe"
      ],
      "to": [
        "dossierMarkdown",
        "openReport",
        "FuentesMenu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "keys": [
        "pubmed",
        "esearch",
        "efetch"
      ],
      "to": [
        "count",
        "ids",
        "records"
      ]
    },
    {
      "keys": [
        "extractor",
        "ia",
        "worker"
      ],
      "to": [
        "extractRows",
        "normalizeTopic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "keys": [
        "app",
        "raiz"
      ],
      "to": [
        "App"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pathBoosts": [
    {
      "path": "src/pipeline/run.js",
      "boost": 2
    },
    {
      "path": "src/pipeline/gate.js",
      "boost": 2
    },
    {
      "path": "src/App.jsx",
      "boost": 1
    }
  ],
  "methodReminder": [
    "Lee docs/CORE.md antes de tocar nada: es la fuente de verdad.",
    "Las listas de capas, huecos, roles, predicados y decisiones viven SOLO en src/method/*.json; el código las lee de src/method/method.js.",
    "Ninguna fila entra sin pasar src/pipeline/gate.js (frase literal, números en la frase, capa confirmada por léxico).",
    "Toda decisión de método nueva se añade a src/method/decisions.json con opciones, porqué y evidencia: se exporta con cada dossier."
  ],
  "flowReminder": [
    "tema → run.js (consulta → mapa MeSH → selección → lectura → extracción + gate → OA) → dossier → aggregate/chain/graph → UI y exportación"
  ]
}
